   "system": {
    "description": "<p>Touch. Restores all of the target's HP except <strong>1d4</strong>, and ends <strong>Blinded</strong>, <strong>Deafened</strong>, <strong>Stunned</strong>, <strong>Paralysed</strong>, poison and disease. Cast reversed (Harm): touching a creature reduces it to <strong>1d4</strong> HP (no effect if it already has fewer); <strong>Fortitude negates</strong>.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Reversible:</strong> may be cast as its opposite with the same slot.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric, Druid, Witch</p>",
